## Required Behaviors (Smoothness)

1. **Local controlled input** — Keep `inputValue` in component state. Do **not** drive the input solely from URL/`router` on every keystroke (flicker / list refetch thrash).
2. **Do not write partial typeahead text into the URL or list fetch** — Typing filters the dropdown only. Commit `?tenant=` / `searchTerm` on suggestion select, Enter, Search, the Clear control, or when Backspace/Delete empties the field. Select All (Ctrl/Cmd+A) and then Backspace or Delete is the same clear: the highlighted range is removed, and if the trimmed field is empty the list resets. A highlighted range that still leaves text does not commit. Debouncing partial strings into the URL or a listing `useEffect` causes wrong filters and refetch thrash.
3. **Multi-field server (and local) match** — See Core Principle above. Never ship a typeahead that only searches the pretty name when users also know the id/code. Never ship a listing fetch that only searches `searchText` when the menu matches title/name.
4. **`onMouseDown` + `preventDefault` on options** — So input `blur` does not close the menu before `click` runs.
5. **Click-outside closes** — `mousedown` on `document`; ignore events inside the container `ref`.
6. **Keyboard** — `Enter` selects the only filtered match (or commits typed value); `Escape` closes; optionally `ArrowDown` opens.
7. **ARIA** — `role="combobox"`; `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`, `aria-autocomplete="list"`; list `role="listbox"` / `role="option"`. Prefer `useId()` for listbox ids; keep stable product ids (e.g. `admin-filter-tenant-id`) when tests/docs reference them.
8. **Clear control** — Clear button uses `onMouseDown={(e) => e.preventDefault()}`.
9. **Resolve URL → label once** — Hydrating a label from a committed id: guard with `resolveAttemptedRef`; accept **exact id matches only** (never `results[0]`). Do **not** put the growing suggestion cache in that effect’s deps in a way that re-fires the same search (infinite loop).
10. **Resolve URL → label once** — Hydrating a label from a committed id: guard with `resolveAttemptedRef`; accept **exact id matches only** (never `results[0]`). Do **not** put the growing suggestion cache in that effect’s deps in a way that re-fires the same search (infinite loop).
11. **Shared extras** — Pass the same date/active/sort extras into typeahead as the list (`endDate.lessThan` vs `startDate.greaterThanOrEqual` on `/events`) so the menu cannot promise a row the grid will drop.
