## Public `/sponsors` catalog

The sponsors page keeps its own search in [`SponsorsCatalogSearch.tsx`](mdc:src/components/sponsors/SponsorsCatalogSearch.tsx). Typing updates the suggestion menu only. The catalog refetches when the search is committed ([`src/app/sponsors/page.tsx`](mdc:src/app/sponsors/page.tsx)).

Both list and suggestion fetches use **`fetchPublicSearchPage` + `PUBLIC_SPONSOR_SEARCH_FIELDS`** (not `searchText.contains` alone). Suggestion menu requests `size=20` and reads `x-total-count` (max across jobs). The client slices to `SUGGESTION_LIMIT` (20) again. Merge remote with a **local** filter of the currently loaded page (`name`, `companyName`, `tagline`, `description`, `type`, `searchText`, `id`) so the menu is not blank while remote is in flight.

Wrap the search band in `<form onSubmit>` so the Search button and Enter both call `commitSearch` even if the input handler misses.

Commit with `commitSearch`: trim the value, set draft + committed term, `setPage(0)` / `setCurrentPage(1)`, and close the menu. Call it from:

- Enter on the input (`preventDefault`, then commit the typed text). Enter does not replace the text with a highlighted suggestion.
- A suggestion click, which commits that sponsor's `name`.
- **Click Enter for more**, which commits the typed text the same way Enter does.
- Clear, which commits `''`.
- Form submit (Search button `type="submit"`).
- Backspace, Delete, or the native search clear that leaves the trimmed field empty. Select All and then Backspace or Delete is included: deleting the highlighted value calls the same `commitSearch('')` / clear handler as the Clear button and restores the unfiltered list. Deleting characters, or a highlighted range, that still leaves text does not commit.
- Form submit (Search button `type="submit"`).

Every option and the more-row use `onMouseDown={(event) => event.preventDefault()}` so blur does not drop the click. Click-outside still closes the menu. Escape closes it without committing.

When `totalCount` is greater than 20, the menu still lists 20 sponsors and adds one last row, **Click Enter for more**. That row is not `role="option"` and it is not a 21st sponsor.

The catalog pages at 20 (`PAGE_SIZE`) and reads `x-total-count`, so Enter on a query with more than 20 matches shows `Showing 1 to 20 of N` and Next.

```tsx
// ✅ DO: menu while typing; catalog only after Enter, a suggestion, or the more-row
onKeyDown={(event) => {
  if (event.key === 'Enter') {
    event.preventDefault();
    commitSearch(searchDraft);
  }
}}
```

```tsx
// ✅ DO: last row when more than 20 matches — not another sponsor
{suggestionTotal > SUGGESTION_LIMIT ? (
  <button type="button" className="md-sp-search__more" onMouseDown={(e) => e.preventDefault()} onClick={() => commitSearch(searchDraft)}>
    Click Enter for more
  </button>
) : null}
```

```typescript
