## Public listing search (`mh-events-search`)

`/sponsors` follows **Public `/sponsors` catalog** above. Other public pages that share the organic search band (`.mh-events-search`) use the shared combobox when `PublicListSearchCombobox` and `publicTypeaheadSearch.ts` are present.

```tsx
// ✅ DO: draft while typing; commit on select / Enter / Search
// Remote: same PUBLIC_* field list for typeahead AND listing
<PublicListSearchCombobox<EventDetailsDTO & Record<string, unknown>>
  committedValue={searchTerm}
  onCommit={commitSearch}
  onInputChange={setSearchDraft}
  searchRemote={(query) =>
    fetchPublicTypeahead<EventDetailsDTO>({
      resource: 'event-details',
      query,
      containsFields: PUBLIC_EVENT_SEARCH_FIELDS,
      extraParams, // same past/future or date-range extras as the list fetch
    })
  }
  getSearchFields={(event) => [
    event.searchText, event.title, event.caption, event.description, event.location, event.id,
  ]}
  getCommitValue={(event) => event.title || ''}
  formatPrimary={(event) => event.title || 'Untitled event'}
/>
```

- **Reuse, do not fork.** `PublicListSearchCombobox` only sets `mh-typeahead` / `mh-typeahead-input` classes. Behavior stays in `AdminListSearchCombobox` (debounce 280ms, cap 20, merge local+remote, ARIA combobox).
- **`committedValue` vs `onInputChange`.** Listing fetch depends on the committed string. `onInputChange` keeps the Search button in sync with typed text without refetching.
- **Remote search on public pages.** Client: [`fetchPublicTypeahead`](mdc:src/lib/publicTypeaheadSearch.ts) / [`fetchPublicSearchPage`](mdc:src/lib/publicTypeaheadSearch.ts) → relative `/api/proxy/{resource}` via `proxyApiPath`. Do **not** add `tenantId.equals` (the proxy injects it). Do **not** call `getAppUrl()` from the browser. Parse list bodies with `parseProxyList` (array / `content` / HAL) — do not treat a non-array body as one fake row.
- **Committed listing.** When `searchTerm` is set, use `fetchPublicSearchPage` with the **same** `containsFields` and extras as typeahead. Empty term stays a single unfiltered request. `totalCount` is `max(x-total-count)` across jobs.
- **Gallery server actions.** [`ApiServerActions.ts`](mdc:src/app/gallery/ApiServerActions.ts) `fetchAlbumsForGallery` / `fetchEventsForGallery` parallel the album/event field lists via `fetchWithJwtRetry` (copy extras, merge by id). Empty term stays one request.
- **Keep Search / Clear / date range.** Typeahead replaces only the text field. Date inputs and the Search/Clear buttons stay. Search commits the current draft. Clear commits `''`. Backspace or Delete that empties the field, including Select All and then Backspace or Delete, commits `''` through the same handler. A deletion that still leaves text does not commit.
- **Focus groups** already load the full set client-side — local `AdminListSearchCombobox` / `FcCatalogTypeahead` is enough (no `searchRemote`); include `searchText`, name, slug, description, id.
- **MD Strikers:** keep `FcCatalogTypeahead`; wire list + suggestions to `PUBLIC_*` fields. Do not drop in `PublicListSearchCombobox`.

| Public page | Combobox | Remote resource / fields |
|-------------|----------|--------------------------|
| [`/sponsors`](mdc:src/app/sponsors/page.tsx) | [`SponsorsCatalogSearch`](mdc:src/components/sponsors/SponsorsCatalogSearch.tsx) | `event-sponsors` — `PUBLIC_SPONSOR_SEARCH_FIELDS`; menu 20; Enter pages the rest |
| [`/events`](mdc:src/app/events/page.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-details` — `PUBLIC_EVENT_SEARCH_FIELDS` + same date extras as the list |
| [`/gallery`](mdc:src/app/gallery/components/GallerySearch.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | albums: `PUBLIC_GALLERY_ALBUM_SEARCH_FIELDS`; events: `PUBLIC_EVENT_SEARCH_FIELDS` |
| [`/polls`](mdc:src/components/polls/PollList.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-polls` — `title`, `description`, id |
| [`/focus-groups`](mdc:src/app/focus-groups/FocusGroupsGridWithSearch.tsx) | `AdminListSearchCombobox` | local **`searchText`**, name, slug, description, id |

