## Where It Applies

- **Shared Tenant ID typeahead:** [`AdminTenantFilterField`](mdc:src/app/admin/AdminTenantFilterField.tsx) — use this on every admin list search form that filters by tenant (do not reinvent a plain text Tenant ID input).
- Pages already wired (same multi-field search): Manage Usage, **Gallery Albums** (`/admin/gallery/albums`), Manage Events, executive committee, sponsors, contacts, performers, program directors, email modules, manual payments, satellite domains, tenant settings list, etc. Admin free-text that used `searchText.contains` alone has the same empty-blob risk as public listings — prefer parallel structured fields when adding or fixing search.
- Admin top bar: [`AdminTenantContext`](mdc:src/app/admin/AdminTenantContext.tsx) — hide top bar when the page already has an in-form `AdminTenantFilterField` (`hasInlineTenantFilter`).
- When a tenant is selected (`?tenant=`), list/create server actions must pass **`tenantId.equals` + `X-Tenant-ID`** for that tenant (see manage-usage + gallery albums `ApiServerActions`).
- Org pickers: [`TenantOrganizationSearchSelect`](mdc:src/app/admin/tenant-management/components/TenantOrganizationSearchSelect.tsx)
- Shared search action: [`searchTenantOrganizationsForSelectServer`](mdc:src/app/admin/tenant-management/organizations/organizationSelectServerActions.ts)
- Event pickers: `EventSearchSelect` under newsletter / promotion emails (extend with id/title multi-field when adding search)
- Any new admin typeahead / combobox filter — default to **multi-field** match + reuse `AdminTenantFilterField` for tenant
- **Public `/sponsors`** — custom [`SponsorsCatalogSearch.tsx`](mdc:src/components/sponsors/SponsorsCatalogSearch.tsx) with `PUBLIC_SPONSOR_SEARCH_FIELDS`. See **Public `/sponsors` catalog** above. Do not replace it with `AdminListSearchCombobox`.
- **Other public listing search** — `/events`, `/gallery`, `/polls`, `/focus-groups` (see **Public listing search** above). A new `mh-events-search` text field uses `PublicListSearchCombobox` + `fetchPublicTypeahead` / `fetchPublicSearchPage` when those files exist, or local items if the full set is already loaded.

## Data Loading Checklist

- [ ] Recent-N list on open, then **debounced** server search as the query grows
- [ ] Match **label + id/key** fields (and other natural identifiers when cheap)
- [ ] Public OCR-backed listings: `PUBLIC_*_SEARCH_FIELDS` (structured columns **plus** `searchText`) — never `searchText.contains` alone, never `ocrText.contains`
- [ ] Committed listing after Enter uses **`fetchPublicSearchPage`** with the **same** `containsFields` and extras as typeahead
- [ ] Parallel `.contains` queries (one field per request); **merge/dedupe** by id; JHipster ANDs if combined
- [ ] Cap suggestions (~20) for snappy menus
- [ ] Merge server + local matches so empty blob-only responses do not clear title/name hits
- [ ] Placeholder text mentions what can be typed (e.g. “Search by Tenant ID or organization name…”)
- [ ] Public pages: relative `/api/proxy/*` via `fetchPublicTypeahead` / `fetchPublicSearchPage` — no `getAppUrl()`, no `tenantId.equals` in the query
- [ ] Public `mh-events-search` title/name field is a combobox, not a raw `<input>`
- [ ] `/sponsors` menu lists at most 20 suggestions, returns `x-total-count`, and shows **Click Enter for more** when the total is above 20
- [ ] `/sponsors` catalog changes on Enter, a suggestion pick, that more-row, Search submit, or Clear — never on a typing timer
- [ ] `/sponsors` catalog changes on Enter, a suggestion pick, that more-row, Search submit, Clear, when Backspace/Delete empties the field, or when Select All and then Backspace/Delete removes the whole value — never on a typing timer while text remains
